3. How to Circumvent the ATS "Degree Wall"
If pursuing a non-degree path, candidates bypass automated filters using three proven strategies:

Direct Networking & Internal Referrals: Submitting a resume via employee referral bypasses the front-door ATS screen entirely. A hiring manager can override a HR degree policy for a recommended candidate with 5 years of proven results.

Equivalency Framing on the CV: Format the education section to emphasize vocational training, professional certifications, or continuous learning (e.g., "Professional Certifications & 5+ Years Industry Practice").

