For a single PAYE employee in 2026:


Income tax: 20% up to €44,000, 40% thereafter.

Standard USC bands apply.

Employee PRSI is approximately 4.2% for ordinary Class A employment.

Actual take-home varies with credits, pension contributions, benefits, PRSI class and personal circumstances.
The model therefore uses approximate take-home pay rather than treating gross salary as spendable income.

Education assumptions

For a conventional Level 8 student:


Student contribution: €2,500/year from 2026/27.

Four years = €10,000 direct contribution.

Additional living/accommodation/transport cost is highly variable.
